The Heavy Hand of God is a warship of the [[Org/The Fifth Prosperous Empire of the Sundom|Sundom]], recovered by [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] and kept as the largest thing it has ever fielded. It is a crescent fifteen miles across, thick at the middle, with cords running from its two horns to an engine at the center where a captured sun hangs for propulsion. Its hull is smooth metal with no doors worth the name; the metal parts and liquefies to let a boarding party in. Its decks carry banks of railguns, lasers and stranger weapons, enough firepower to unmake a [[Phenomena/Crystal Sphere|crystal sphere]] and everything in it.

The Sundom built the ship for its war with the [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessians]] and never used it; the empire fell first. Sedecium found it after a gap in its data led to a hidden weapons platform of the third Sundom, took it apart to learn how every piece worked, and put it back together as its own.
